Place the hero film here as: wedding-video.mp4

It is the background of the first section — full-bleed, muted, looping — and it
is used again, paused until in view, behind the closing frame.

H.264 / MP4. Around 10-20 seconds and under ~8 MB is plenty behind typography;
the file is downloaded by every guest, most of them on a phone.

Nothing is fetched or decoded while the envelope is still sealed. Until this
file exists the hero shows public/images/wedding-hero-poster.jpg instead, and
nothing breaks.
